{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-06-07 09:30:00', 'title': 'SERAMOUNT AGAIN NAMES FLEISHMANHILLARD A 2022 TOP 10 COMPANY FOR EXECUTIVE WOMEN', 'text': "ST. LOUIS , JUNE 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FLEISHMANHILLARD WAS NAMED IN THE TOP 10 OF SERAMOUNT'S 2022 TOP COMPANIES FOR EXECUTIVE WOMEN LIST TODAY, IT'S SEVENTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR IN THE TOP 10 AND 13TH YEAR ON THE LIST. SERAMOUNT, PART OF EAB, CONTINUES TO EXPLORE WAYS ORGANIZATIONS CAN MOVE MORE WOMEN INTO TOP POSITIONS, WHILE HIGHLIGHTING THE SUCCESSES AT THESE TRAILBLAZING COMPANIES."}